# Source art (FBX, PNG, heightmaps). Redistribution restricted, so it stays out of the repo.
StrideTerrain.Sample/Resources/*

# Assets are the Stride side of the pipeline - material graphs, model and texture import settings,
# scenes, prefabs. They are authored here, they are small, and they are what actually breaks, so
# they belong in version control even though the Resources they point at do not. Without them a
# rendering regression that lives in a material graph cannot be bisected at all.
!StrideTerrain.Sample/Assets/
StrideTerrain.Editor/Resources/Valley_normal.dds
StrideTerrain.Editor/Resources/Valley_roughness.dds